{{!
    @template local_coursegen/template_course_sections

    "Course sections" review on the create-template screen: one collapsible
    card per section (expanded by default) holding a report-style table of
    its activities. Each row carries a selection checkbox and a compact
    action select preselected with its type's default action; each section
    table a select-all checkbox in its header, and ONE global bulk action
    bar sits below all the cards ("With selected activities…", born
    disabled). local/template/sections_events.js binds all of them after
    every render (initial page load and AJAX course switch).

    The collapse ids are deterministic (course id + section id) instead of
    the uniqid helper: its output can start with a digit, which is not a
    valid CSS identifier, so Bootstrap 4 silently drops the data-target
    selector and the toggle does nothing. (No literal double closing braces
    may appear anywhere in this comment either — they would end it early
    and dump the rest of the docblock as page content.)

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-for="section" data-id on each section card
    * data-for="cmitem" data-id + data-modname + data-typelabel on each
      real activity row (data-typelabel lets the instance-menu builder read
      a template mold's type label without a string lookup)
    * data-for="instancerow" data-instance-id on each virtual instance row
      (never carries data-modname: it must stay outside every selector that
      targets real activities, e.g. selection_bulk.js's checkbox queries or
      type_action_sync.js's default-seeding pass)
    * data-region="section-behavior" data-sid on each header's behavior select
    * data-region="activity-action" data-id on each row's action select
    * data-region="activity-select" data-id on each row's checkbox
    * data-region="select-all" on each section table's header checkbox
    * data-region="section-select-all" data-sid on each section card
      header's checkbox (usable while the section is collapsed)
    * data-region="bulk-action" on the single global bulk select
    * data-region="template-tag" data-id + data-name + data-tag-course +
      data-tag-section on each row's clickable "Template" tag, next to the
      activity name (hidden unless the row's action is "template") — opens
      local/template/template_scope_modal.js to set/change the row's scope
    * data-region="row-gap" on the thin hover-reveal strip rendered after
      every row except the section's last one (that gap is skipped: the
      persistent "Add activity" row right below already covers the same
      insertion point), and data-region="add-instance" on that persistent trailing
      "Add activity from a template" row — each trigger carries
      data-toggle="dropdown" (so Bootstrap's own outside-click/Escape
      handling can close it) and sits inside its own ".dropdown" wrapper
      next to an empty ".dropdown-menu" sibling
      (local/template/template_instance_menu.js renders the picker body into
      that sibling and opens it as a native Bootstrap dropdown); picking an
      item inserts that template's instance immediately before the element
      that follows the trigger

    Each "rows" entry is rendered by the local_coursegen/template_course_sections_row
    partial (its own row plus the hover-reveal gap after it) — split out to
    keep this file under the project's 250-line cap.
    * data-region="instance-name" data-id on each instance row's editable
      name input
    * data-region="instance-prompt-toggle" data-id on each instance row's
      edit-instructions icon; data-region="instance-remove" data-id on its
      remove icon

    Context variables required for this template:
    * courseid int          - Base course id (keeps collapse ids unique per course)
    * hassections bool      - True when the course has any section
    * scopelabelcourse string  - "Whole course" scope label, for the tag's data-tag-course
    * scopelabelsection string - "This section only" scope label, for data-tag-section
    * sections array   - Sections, each with: id int, num int, name string,
                         activitycount int, hasactivities bool,
                         actions array (value, sectionid, label, tip, active),
                         rows array, each either a real activity row
                         (isreal true, isinstance false, cmid, name, modname,
                         typelabel, iconurl, viewurl, actions array,
                         istemplate bool, scopelabel string) or a virtual
                         instance row (isreal false, isinstance true,
                         instanceid, name, typelabel, prompt, sourcecmid,
                         sourcename, badge string) — every entry also
                         carries islast bool (true only for the section's
                         final row, which renders no trailing gap)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "courseid": 3,
        "hassections": true,
        "scopelabelcourse": "Whole course",
        "scopelabelsection": "This section only",
        "sections": [
            {
                "id": 11,
                "num": 1,
                "name": "Topic 1",
                "activitycount": 1,
                "hasactivities": true,
                "actions": [
                    {"value": "custom", "sectionid": 11, "label": "Customised", "tip": "Configure each activity", "active": true}
                ],
                "rows": [
                    {
                        "isreal": true,
                        "isinstance": false,
                        "cmid": 42,
                        "name": "Welcome page",
                        "modname": "page",
                        "typelabel": "Page",
                        "iconurl": "https://example.com/theme/image.php/boost/page/1/monologo",
                        "actions": [
                            {"value": "keep", "cmid": 42, "label": "Keep intact", "tip": "The activity is copied exactly as is", "active": true}
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="local_coursegen-template_course_sections" data-region="course-sections">
{{#sections}}
    <div class="tpl-section-card" data-for="section" data-id="{{id}}" data-number="{{num}}">
        <div class="tpl-section-header d-flex align-items-center">
            {{#hasactivities}}
            {{! A sibling of the collapse toggle, never inside it: checking
                it must not collapse/expand the section. }}
            <input type="checkbox" class="mr-2" data-region="section-select-all" data-sid="{{id}}"
                   aria-label="{{name}}">
            {{/hasactivities}}
            <button type="button"
                    class="btn btn-link text-reset text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center text-left p-0 flex-grow-1 tpl-section-toggle"
                    data-toggle="collapse"
                    data-target="#local-coursegen-tpl-section-{{courseid}}-{{id}}"
                    aria-expanded="true"
                    aria-controls="local-coursegen-tpl-section-{{courseid}}-{{id}}">
                <i class="icon fa fa-chevron-down fa-fw tpl-section-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span class="font-weight-bold">{{name}}</span>
                <span class="badge badge-pill badge-secondary ml-2">
                    {{#str}} template_activities_count, local_coursegen, {{activitycount}} {{/str}}
                </span>
            </button>
            {{! A sibling of the collapse toggle, never inside it: opening
                the select must not collapse/expand the section. }}
            <select class="custom-select custom-select-sm tpl-section-behavior ml-auto"
                    data-region="section-behavior" data-sid="{{id}}"
                    aria-label="{{#str}} actions, core {{/str}}">
                {{#actions}}
                <option value="{{value}}" title="{{tip}}"{{#active}} selected{{/active}}>{{label}}</option>
                {{/actions}}
            </select>
        </div>
        <div class="collapse show" id="local-coursegen-tpl-section-{{courseid}}-{{id}}">
            <table class="table generaltable table-hover mb-0 tpl-activity-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col" class="tpl-select-col">
                            <input type="checkbox" data-region="select-all"
                                   aria-label="{{#str}} selectall, core {{/str}}">
                        </th>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}} name, core {{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col" class="tpl-col-type">{{#str}} template_table_type, local_coursegen {{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col" class="text-right tpl-col-actions">{{#str}} actions, core {{/str}}</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#rows}}
                    {{> local_coursegen/template_course_sections_row}}
                    {{/rows}}
                    <tr class="tpl-row-add" data-region="add-instance">
                        <td colspan="4">
                            <div class="dropdown tpl-instance-dropdown">
                                <button type="button" class="tpl-add-instance-btn" data-instance-menu-trigger
                                        data-toggle="dropdown"
                                        aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">
                                    <span>&#65291;</span>
                                    <span>{{#str}} template_add_instance, local_coursegen {{/str}}</span>
                                </button>
                                <div class="dropdown-menu tpl-instance-menu" role="menu"></div>
                            </div>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
{{/sections}}
{{#hassections}}
    <div class="tpl-bulk-bar d-flex align-items-center flex-wrap" data-region="bulk-bar">
        <label class="mb-0 mr-2" for="local-coursegen-bulk-action-{{courseid}}">
            {{#str}} template_with_selected_activities, local_coursegen {{/str}}
        </label>
        <select class="custom-select custom-select-sm tpl-bulk-select"
                id="local-coursegen-bulk-action-{{courseid}}"
                data-region="bulk-action" disabled>
            <option value="" selected>{{#str}} choosedots, core {{/str}}</option>
            <option value="template">{{#str}} template_activity_template, local_coursegen {{/str}}</option>
            <option value="keep">{{#str}} template_activity_keep, local_coursegen {{/str}}</option>
            <option value="reference">{{#str}} template_activity_reference, local_coursegen {{/str}}</option>
            <option value="exclude">{{#str}} template_activity_exclude, local_coursegen {{/str}}</option>
        </select>
    </div>
{{/hassections}}
</div>
